NAME
    gcloud service-health events - represents events that may affect Google
        Cloud products

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud service-health events COMMAND [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    Represents events that may affect Google Cloud products.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     describe
        Get details of an event affecting a project.

     list
        List events under a given project and location.

NOTES
    These variants are also available:

        $ gcloud alpha service-health events

        $ gcloud beta service-health events

